WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.201 --> 00:00:04.711 line:72% position:50% align:center
An order is a sale paid for or handed over later

2
00:00:08.139 --> 00:00:11.929 line:72% position:50% align:center
Choose the customer: the order is in their name

3
00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:16.820 line:72% position:50% align:center
Tap Reserve order instead of Pay now

4
00:00:18.182 --> 00:00:22.212 line:72% position:50% align:center
Choose whether they pick it up or you deliver it

5
00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:24.169 line:72% position:50% align:center
Tap Create order

6
00:00:27.239 --> 00:00:30.869 line:72% position:50% align:center
If they leave a deposit, record it right here

7
00:00:40.543 --> 00:00:43.933 line:72% position:50% align:center
Orders shows every open order

8
00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:51.049 line:72% position:50% align:center
When you start getting it ready, tap Prepare

9
00:00:53.777 --> 00:00:57.727 line:72% position:50% align:center
When it's ready to pick up, Mark ready

10
00:01:00.479 --> 00:01:04.189 line:72% position:50% align:center
With the customer's permission, you can tell them on WhatsApp

11
00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:06.867 line:72% position:50% align:center
When you hand it over, collect the balance

12
00:01:11.291 --> 00:01:14.041 line:72% position:50% align:center
and tap Mark delivered

13
00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:21.504 line:72% position:50% align:center
The order's timeline keeps every step and every payment
